WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.390
- So by now you've probably seen

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.200
the harrowing footage of
Daunte Wright being shot

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.410
in what was supposed to
be a routine traffic stop.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.800
And reports are that one of
the officers on the scene

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.220
intended to draw a taser but
instead drew her service weapon

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.529
and shot Daunte Wright in the chest.

00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:14.940
- [Woman] Taser, taser, taser!

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.680
- Now, many people have
suggested that this officer

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.390
could be charged with
involuntary manslaughter

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.650
and that could fit but
this has happened before.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.840
In New Hope, Pennsylvania, an
officer shot an unarmed man

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.390
in a holding cell thinking
that he was pulling his taser.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:27.860
The man survived and the district attorney

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.140
didn't press any charges.

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.200
Though in two other cases
in Oakland, California,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.060
and Tulsa, Oklahoma where the
police officers drew a gun

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.350
instead of a taser, they were convicted

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.420
of killing the victims in those cases.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.730
So we'll see what happens
in this particular case.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.353
It's a tragedy either way.

